{"id": "urban-ed-two-portraits", "title": "A City grantee commissioned $5,500 portraits of two City officials", "seconds": 130.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "tempo": 1.141, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "0c63689d171aa335", "words": 390, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "Urban Ed Academy puts Black male teachers in classrooms. The City paid it about 2.96 million dollars.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 6.23, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Urban Ed Academy", "sub": "puts Black male teachers in classrooms"}, "emph": ["2.96 million"], "wt": [0.0, 0.26, 0.46, 0.95, 1.22, 1.5, 1.7, 2.04, 2.14, 3.07, 3.34, 3.6, 3.79, 3.89, 4.16, 4.32, 4.64, 4.8, 5.01, 5.37]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["oneLine", "story[1]"], "text": "In 2023, it paid an artist for painted portraits of two City officials. How much for each?", "t0": 6.35, "t1": 12.14, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Two painted portraits", "sub": "of two City officials"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.39, 1.29, 1.39, 1.66, 1.79, 2.07, 2.23, 2.64, 3.11, 3.23, 3.51, 3.84, 4.66, 5.02, 5.24, 5.44]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["oneLine", "established[0]"], "text": "5,500 dollars.", "t0": 12.14, "t1": 14.43, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$5,500", "label": "per portrait"}, "emph": ["5,500"], "wt": [0.04, 0.7, 1.15, 1.46, 1.7]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["story[3]", "established[1]"], "text": "In March 2025, the City’s auditor, the Controller, reviewed it.", "t0": 14.95, "t1": 18.77, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "creates at least the appearance of a bribe"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.4, 0.61, 1.53, 1.68, 1.96, 2.49, 2.59, 3.22, 3.55]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["story[3]", "established[1]"], "text": "It said one portrait creates at least the appearance of a bribe.", "t0": 18.89, "t1": 22.06, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "creates at least the appearance of a bribe"}, "emph": ["appearance"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.33, 0.55, 1.03, 1.38, 1.51, 1.74, 1.94, 2.46, 2.63, 2.74]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[0]"], "text": "First, what’s settled. In June 2023, Urban Ed gave Supervisor Shamann Walton his portrait.", "t0": 22.28, "t1": 28.99, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Supervisor Shamann Walton", "sub": "June 2023, Black Educators Night Out"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.64, 0.86, 1.59, 2.35, 2.6, 2.82, 3.81, 4.11, 4.3, 4.52, 5.08, 5.51, 5.92, 6.12]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[0]"], "text": "What was the gift limit that year?", "t0": 29.11, "t1": 30.37, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Supervisor Shamann Walton", "sub": "June 2023, Black Educators Night Out"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.26, 0.36, 0.56, 0.78, 0.99]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "story[1]"], "text": "590 dollars.", "t0": 30.37, "t1": 32.21, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$590", "label": "the gift limit from one source", "sub": "the portrait was more than nine times that"}, "emph": ["590"], "wt": [0.04, 0.64, 0.93, 1.29]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[7]", "established[0]"], "text": "He hung it in his City Hall office.", "t0": 32.73, "t1": 34.32, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "he did not consider it a gift"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.3, 0.42, 0.5, 0.65, 0.86, 1.09]}, {"scene": "found", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[4]", "established[0]"], "text": "In July 2026, he admitted taking it, and not reporting it. 500 dollars for each.", "t0": 34.44, "t1": 39.88, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Admitted, July 10, 2026", "sub": "$500 for each count"}, "emph": ["admitted"], "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.44, 0.77, 1.53, 1.62, 1.98, 2.3, 2.58, 2.68, 2.88, 3.24, 3.49, 3.86, 4.17, 4.63, 4.79]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[2]"], "text": "The second portrait is the bigger question.", "t0": 40.1, "t1": 42.01, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Human Rights Commission", "kicker": "The second portrait", "sub": "director Sheryl Davis"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.05, 0.4, 0.84, 1.0, 1.09, 1.38]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "story[2]"], "text": "In June 2023, Urban Ed asked the Human Rights Commission for money.", "t0": 42.13, "t1": 46.28, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Human Rights Commission", "kicker": "The second portrait", "sub": "director Sheryl Davis"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.38, 0.6, 1.6, 1.99, 2.24, 2.61, 2.71, 2.97, 3.19, 3.54, 3.71]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "story[2]"], "text": "That made it a restricted source for the director, Sheryl Davis.", "t0": 46.4, "t1": 49.39, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "restricted source"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.39, 0.52, 0.6, 1.09, 1.41, 1.48, 1.59, 2.21, 2.52]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why", "story[2]"], "text": "Since it wanted her money, she couldn’t take its gifts.", "t0": 49.51, "t1": 52.25, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "restricted source"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.38, 0.66, 0.82, 1.38, 1.57, 1.86, 2.06, 2.24]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "On December 6, 2023, she got her portrait.", "t0": 52.37, "t1": 55.37, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2023-12-06", "to": "2024-01-01", "days": "26", "fromLab": "portrait to Davis", "toLab": "$270,000 grant", "kicker": "The second portrait"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.46, 0.91, 1.13, 2.11, 2.27, 2.46, 2.6]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]", "established[2]"], "text": "Then her commission signed a grant with Urban Ed. How big?", "t0": 55.49, "t1": 58.7, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2023-12-06", "to": "2024-01-01", "days": "26", "fromLab": "portrait to Davis", "toLab": "$270,000 grant", "kicker": "The second portrait"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.19, 0.61, 0.92, 1.02, 1.16, 1.33, 1.72, 2.31, 2.76]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[1]"], "text": "270,000 dollars.", "t0": 58.7, "t1": 60.83, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$270,000", "label": "grant signed Jan 1, 2024"}, "emph": ["270,000"], "wt": [0.04, 0.55, 0.84, 1.18, 1.55]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "span", "ref": ["amount", "story[2]"], "text": "And how long after the portrait?", "t0": 61.35, "t1": 62.93, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2023-12-06", "to": "2024-01-01", "days": "26", "fromLab": "portrait to Davis", "toLab": "$270,000 grant", "kicker": "The second portrait"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.27, 0.48, 0.73, 0.82]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["story[2]"], "text": "26 days.", "t0": 62.93, "t1": 64.7, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "26", "label": "days later"}, "emph": ["26"], "wt": [0.04, 1.3]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "In November 2025, the Ethics Commission’s director found probable cause against her.", "t0": 65.22, "t1": 70.18, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "an accusation, not a finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.52, 0.8, 1.76, 1.86, 2.19, 2.63, 3.06, 3.4, 3.83, 4.17, 4.51]}, {"scene": "lead1", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]", "notEstablished[1]"], "text": "That’s an accusation, not a finding.", "t0": 70.3, "t1": 72.17, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "an accusation, not a finding"}, "emph": ["not a finding"], "wt": [0.0, 0.21, 0.32, 1.14, 1.28, 1.37]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "Another finding: Urban Ed’s director sat on a committee that oversees a City program, Dream Keeper.", "t0": 72.39, "t1": 77.34, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Randal Seriguchi, Jr.", "sub": "Urban Ed’s director, 2016 to January 2024"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "Community Accountability Committee", "sub": "oversees Dream Keeper"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Dream Keeper money", "sub": "paid to Urban Ed"}], "kicker": "Another finding"}, "wt": [0.17, 0.28, 0.96, 1.29, 1.51, 1.93, 2.11, 2.2, 2.27, 2.6, 2.7, 3.14, 3.25, 3.48, 4.17, 4.45]}, {"scene": "lead2", "kind": "chain", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "Dream Keeper was paying Urban Ed.", "t0": 77.46, "t1": 79.3, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "chain", "steps": [{"art": "contract", "name": "Randal Seriguchi, Jr.", "sub": "Urban Ed’s director, 2016 to January 2024"}, {"art": "gavel", "name": "Community Accountability Committee", "sub": "oversees Dream Keeper"}, {"art": "money", "name": "Dream Keeper money", "sub": "paid to Urban Ed"}], "kicker": "Another finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.55, 0.72, 1.12, 1.43]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[4]"], "text": "One more. Urban Ed won grants with lower scores than rivals.", "t0": 79.52, "t1": 82.95, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Lower scores, still funded", "kicker": "One more finding"}, "wt": [0.18, 0.29, 0.85, 1.27, 1.51, 1.72, 2.04, 2.19, 2.42, 2.75, 2.92]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[4]"], "text": "One grew, though it fell far short of its goals. By how much?", "t0": 83.07, "t1": 86.71, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Lower scores, still funded", "kicker": "One more finding"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.71, 0.82, 0.95, 1.17, 1.38, 1.64, 1.72, 1.88, 2.57, 2.84, 3.0]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "established[4]"], "text": "755,000 dollars.", "t0": 86.71, "t1": 88.97, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$755,000", "label": "added by OEWD", "sub": "a 173% increase"}, "emph": ["755,000"], "wt": [0.04, 0.39, 0.63, 1.24, 1.61]}, {"scene": "lead3", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[4]", "established[5]"], "text": "In 2024 alone, the City paid Urban Ed 606,749 dollars.", "t0": 89.49, "t1": 95.44, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$755,000", "label": "added by OEWD", "sub": "a 173% increase"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.09, 0.31, 0.84, 1.48, 1.59, 1.87, 2.15, 2.56, 2.88, 3.18, 3.51, 3.83, 4.3, 4.51, 4.82, 5.38]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "The City didn’t suspend Urban Ed. Its grants ended by January 2025.", "t0": 95.66, "t1": 100.12, "shot": "b28", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "Grants ended by January 2025", "sub": "the City did not suspend Urban Ed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.07, 0.27, 0.5, 0.92, 1.25, 1.66, 2.2, 2.6, 2.88, 3.04, 3.51, 3.78]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[8]"], "text": "Then it planned to give 2,000 dollars each to three charities.", "t0": 100.24, "t1": 103.38, "shot": "b25", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Urban Ed’s last $6,000", "sub": "$2,000 each to three charities", "kicker": "The last $6,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.23, 0.52, 0.64, 0.82, 1.07, 1.43, 1.79, 2.06, 2.19, 2.42]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[9]", "suspicious[4].what"], "text": "The State registry says one of them, Matiq Labs, is not registered.", "t0": 103.5, "t1": 107.23, "shot": "b26", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Not Registered", "sub": "the registry’s letter of Oct 14, 2026"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.4, 0.83, 1.09, 1.24, 1.36, 1.81, 2.19, 2.78, 2.93, 3.13]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "notEstablished"], "text": "Its agent shares a name with an Urban Ed director paid 133,009 dollars.", "t0": 107.35, "t1": 112.23, "shot": "b27", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Matiq Labs’ agent", "sub": "same name as an Urban Ed Director paid $133,009"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.44, 0.71, 0.79, 0.98, 1.14, 1.28, 1.59, 1.78, 2.28, 2.55, 2.74, 2.98, 3.53, 3.97, 4.31]}, {"scene": "lead4", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]"], "text": "The records do not show whether this is the same person.", "t0": 112.35, "t1": 114.86, "shot": "b27", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "Matiq Labs’ agent", "sub": "same name as an Urban Ed Director paid $133,009"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.47, 0.61, 0.81, 1.02, 1.3, 1.5, 1.58, 1.73, 1.95]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "The records don’t show either portrait was traded for money.", "t0": 115.08, "t1": 117.85, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That either portrait bought a grant", "That Walton voted on any Urban Ed grant"]}, "wt": [0.03, 0.09, 0.5, 0.73, 1.0, 1.35, 1.76, 1.9, 2.18, 2.34]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "Or that Walton voted on any Urban Ed grant.", "t0": 117.97, "t1": 120.36, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["That either portrait bought a grant", "That Walton voted on any Urban Ed grant"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.36, 0.76, 1.07, 1.26, 1.48, 1.81, 1.97]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[2]"], "text": "What would settle it? A decision in Ethics case 25-838.", "t0": 120.48, "t1": 124.89, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "A decision in Ethics case 25-838"}, {"who": "", "what": "Urban Ed’s invoices for both portraits"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.33, 0.68, 1.24, 1.45, 1.85, 1.96, 2.44, 2.72, 3.4, 3.69]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[2]"], "text": "And Urban Ed’s invoices for both portraits.", "t0": 125.01, "t1": 127.2, "shot": "b22", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "A decision in Ethics case 25-838"}, {"who": "", "what": "Urban Ed’s invoices for both portraits"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.43, 0.69, 1.12, 1.32, 1.53]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 127.32, "t1": 129.37, "shot": "b24", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.28, 0.62, 0.75, 0.95, 1.02, 1.12, 1.39, 1.62]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The question", "found": "On the record", "lead1": "Portrait 2 · 26 days later", "lead2": "A seat on the committee", "lead3": "Lower scores, more money", "lead4": "The last $6,000", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "person"}